A '''chest''' containing supplies can be found in the [[Theatre of Blood]]. It is accessible twice per raid — once after killing the [[Pestilent Bloat]], and once after killing [[Sotetseg]]. It supplies players with different supplies provided by entertained vampyres, purchasable with points earned in the Theatre. Depending on the player's performance, the amount of points a player is given can range from 6 to 13. The points earned from the first chest can carry over to the second chest within the Theatre. 

